WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:09.371
Roscoe and Cleo drew their slingshots. Fwap! Fwap!

2
00:00:09.372 --> 00:00:15.239
Cleo gasped. The pebbles flew right through the outlaw!

3
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.762
He was still walking toward them.

4
00:00:18.763 --> 00:00:22.299
"Roscoe!" Cleo's voice shook.

5
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.245
"He's a ghost! What do we do now?"

6
00:00:26.246 --> 00:00:32.522
Roscoe was shaking too. "We run!"

7
00:00:32.523 --> 00:00:37.746
Cleo ran into a building and slammed the door shut.

8
00:00:37.747 --> 00:00:40.065
She heard banging.

9
00:00:40.066 --> 00:00:43.141
"Let me in!" Roscoe yelled.

10
00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:48.379
"Oops!" Cleo opened it and pulled him inside.

11
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.082
Roscoe frowned.

12
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.253
"We're partners, Cleo! You can't leave me behind."

13
00:00:53.254 --> 00:00:59.066
Cleo grinned sheepishly. "Sorry."

14
00:00:59.067 --> 00:01:03.181
"Thank goodness you found me!" someone said.

15
00:01:03.182 --> 00:01:05.199
They spun around.

16
00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.394
They were inside an old sheriff's office.

17
00:01:08.395 --> 00:01:14.720
Annie was locked inside the jail cell!

18
00:01:14.721 --> 00:01:17.266
Roscoe quickly took off his hat.

19
00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:21.855
"M-miss Annie! I, um, I'm here to rescue you."

20
00:01:21.856 --> 00:01:27.872
Cleo folded her arms. " We're here to rescue

21
00:01:27.873 --> 00:01:30.116
you." She shook the door of the

22
00:01:30.117 --> 00:01:31.915
cell. It didn't

23
00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:35.522
open. "How did you get locked in?" Cleo

24
00:01:35.523 --> 00:01:39.348
asked. "It was the strangest thing," Annie

25
00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:42.763
said. "I was painting wildflowers on Main

26
00:01:42.764 --> 00:01:44.882
Street. I thought I saw a little

27
00:01:44.883 --> 00:01:46.768
girl. She looked

28
00:01:46.769 --> 00:01:51.064
sad. I wanted to help her, but she ran

29
00:01:51.065 --> 00:01:53.708
away." "Where did she go?" Roscoe

30
00:01:53.709 --> 00:01:58.233
asked. "She ran into this building, but I couldn’t find

31
00:01:58.234 --> 00:02:04.145
her. When I checked this cell, the door locked behind me."

32
00:02:04.146 --> 00:02:07.733
"She's a ghost, Annie!" Cleo said.

33
00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:11.033
Annie looked shocked. "What?"

34
00:02:11.034 --> 00:02:13.145
Roscoe nodded.

35
00:02:13.146 --> 00:02:15.668
"We saw a different ghost outside.

36
00:02:15.669 --> 00:02:19.066
Let's find the key and get you out."

37
00:02:19.067 --> 00:02:22.592
He ran around the room, opening doors and cabinets.

38
00:02:22.593 --> 00:02:27.679
Finally he checked a desk drawer. "Found it!"

39
00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:32.680
Roscoe turned the key, and Annie rushed out of the cell.

40
00:02:32.681 --> 00:02:36.095
"Oh, Sheriff! Thank you for rescuing me."

41
00:02:36.096 --> 00:02:40.661
Roscoe's face turned red. "I . . ."

42
00:02:40.662 --> 00:02:43.459
Cleo rolled her eyes.

43
00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.403
"You're welcome, Annie.

44
00:02:45.404 --> 00:02:50.381
Now let's get out of here. I don't want to see any more ghosts!"

45
00:02:50.382 --> 00:02:55.692
Roscoe nodded. "Maybe there's a back door."

46
00:02:55.693 --> 00:02:58.539
They walked down a hallway.

47
00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.539
A door opened to the outside.

48
00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.532
Cleo peeked out.

49
00:03:03.533 --> 00:03:11.419
She didn't see any ghosts.

50
00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:15.054
They rushed down Main Street.

51
00:03:15.055 --> 00:03:21.178
"Let's get our horses and go home," Roscoe said.

52
00:03:21.179 --> 00:03:26.660
"Wait," Annie said. "I need my painting supplies."

53
00:03:26.661 --> 00:03:30.797
Cleo looked around while Annie grabbed her supplies.

54
00:03:30.798 --> 00:03:35.325
Lightning flashed, and thunder rumbled.

55
00:03:35.326 --> 00:03:37.919
"I'm ready!" Annie said.

56
00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:42.088
Roscoe nodded. "Let's—ahh!"

57
00:03:42.089 --> 00:03:46.209
The outlaw ghost was walking toward them.

58
00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:51.236
They turned to run, but another ghost blocked their path.

59
00:03:51.237 --> 00:03:54.673
"That's the little girl!" Annie said.

60
00:03:54.674 --> 00:03:56.755
They turned again.

61
00:03:56.756 --> 00:03:58.937
A third ghost appeared.

62
00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:01.449
He wore a bowtie.

63
00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:11.906
Cleo gulped. "We're surrounded!"

